# The local database and the local blob store.
#
# `.data/blobs` is the filesystem `BlobStore` adapter's root: every segment
# every local upload ever produced. It is regenerable by `pnpm seed` and it is
# the one directory in this project that grows without bound.
.data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Screenshots of the *signed-in* YouTube app.
#
# The visual-research lanes split by sensitivity: the logged-out captures are
# reference material and stay, but the signed-in ones show a real account's
# home feed, subscriptions and watch history, and a screenshot cannot be
# sanitised the way a measurement table can. Everything extracted from them —
# the token values, the type scale, the row geometry — lives on in
# `research/09-youtube-signedin-surfaces.md`, which is the part worth keeping.
research/screenshots/signedin-*

# Source media pulled by the optional `pnpm seed:demo`. Creative Commons, but
# still tens of megabytes of video that has no business in a git history.
public/demo-media/

test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright-mcp/
